n        <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--primary\" href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/visita-guiada-por-ciutadella\/\">Book the family tour<\/a>\n        <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--whatsapp\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/34649902301?text=Hola%20Dani%2C%20queremos%20hacer%20la%20ruta%20familiar%20de%201%20d%C3%ADa%20%F0%9F%8F%A0%E2%80%94%C2%BFnos%20aconsejas%20horarios%20y%20playa%20seg%C3%BAn%20viento%3F\">Direct WhatsApp<\/a>\n        <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--ghost\" href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/excursiones\/\">See all excursions<\/a>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"vm-pills\">\n        <span class=\"vm-badge\">Difficulty: low<\/span>\n        <span class=\"vm-pill\">Stroller OK<\/span>\n        <span class=\"vm-pill\">Shade and restrooms<\/span>\n        <span class=\"vm-pill\">Suitable all year round<\/span>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/section>\n\n  \n  <nav class=\"vm-toc vm-container\" aria-label=\"\u00cdndice del art\u00edculo\">\n    <h2>Index<\/h2>\n    <ol>\n      <li><a href=\"#por-que-funciona\">Why this route works with kids<\/a><\/li>\n      <li><a href=\"#manana-ciutadella\">Morning (9:30\u201311:30 AM): Ciutadella made easy<\/a><\/li>\n      <li><a href=\"#mediodia-playa\">Midday (12:00\u20133:30 PM): Beach depending on the wind<\/a><\/li>\n      <li><a href=\"#siesta\">Nap and ice cream<\/a><\/li>\n      <li><a href=\"#tarde-opciones\">Afternoon: viewpoints or lighthouse<\/a><\/li>\n      <li><a href=\"#lluvia\">Plan B if it rains or is very windy<\/a><\/li>\n      <li><a href=\"#checklist\">Family checklist<\/a><\/li>\n      <li><a href=\"#logistica\">Logistics and parking<\/a><\/li>\n      <li><a href=\"#tiendas-locales\">Local and sustainable shopping<\/a><\/li>\n      <li><a href=\"#faq\">Frequently Asked Questions<\/a><\/li>\n    <\/ol>\n  <\/nav>\n\n  <section id=\"por-que-funciona\" class=\"vm-section vm-container vm-grid\">\n    <div class=\"vm-card\">\n      <h2>Why this route works with kids<\/h2>\n      <p>The secret is to combine <strong>short stretches<\/strong>, places with <strong>shade and restrooms<\/strong>, and a long time for <strong>playing on the beach<\/strong>. From Ciutadella, everything is close by, and we reduce travel. <\/p>\n      <ul class=\"vm-list\">\n        <li><strong>Flexible pace:<\/strong> stops every 20\u201330 minutes.<\/li>\n        <li><strong>Learning + play:<\/strong> short stories and visual challenges (shields, portals, boats).<\/li>\n        <li><strong>Living plan:<\/strong> we choose the beach according to the <em>wind of the day<\/em> to find a better sea.<\/li>\n      <\/ul>\n    <\/div>\n    <aside class=\"vm-card\">\n      <div class=\"vm-kv\">\n        <div><strong>Duration<\/strong><\/div><div>1 full day<\/div>\n        <div><strong>Ages<\/strong><\/div><div>3\u201312 (adaptable)<\/div>\n        <div><strong>Stroller<\/strong><\/div><div>Yes (morning and lighthouse)<\/div>\n        <div><strong>Best time<\/strong><\/div><div>Spring\u2013autumn<\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/aside>\n  <\/section>\n\n  <section id=\"manana-ciutadella\" class=\"vm-section vm-container\">\n    <h2>Morning (9:30\u201311:30 AM): Ciutadella made easy<\/h2>\n    <p>We start when the sun is still gentle. Flat walk through the historic center, with shade and corners that kids love. <\/p>\n    <div class=\"vm-grid\">\n      <div class=\"vm-card\">\n        <h3>Walking route (90\u2013120 min)<\/h3>\n        <ul class=\"vm-list\">\n          <li><strong>Pla\u00e7a des Born<\/strong>: obelisk and views of the old port.<\/li>\n          <li><strong>Cathedral<\/strong>: facade and cloister (when open).<\/li>\n          <li><strong>Streets with palaces<\/strong>: giant doorways and shields.<\/li>\n          <li><strong>Mercat del Peix \/ surroundings<\/strong>: color and local products.<\/li>\n          <li><strong>Descent to the port<\/strong>: boats, shipyards, and photos.<\/li>\n        <\/ul>\n        <p class=\"vm-note\">Mini-game: How many <em>lions<\/em> do you see on the shields? Which door is the largest? <\/p>\n      <\/div>\n      <aside class=\"vm-card\">\n        <h3>Quick tips<\/h3>\n        <ul class=\"vm-list\">\n          <li>Hat and water from the start.<\/li>\n          <li>Restrooms available in bars\/market (consumption recommended).<\/li>\n          <li>Stroller: smooth sidewalks, some streets with cobblestones.<\/li>\n          <li>Book our <a href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/visita-guiada-por-ciutadella\/\">family tour<\/a> for adapted stories.<\/li>\n        <\/ul>\n      <\/aside>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"vm-cta-block vm-container\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n      <div class=\"vm-sticker\">First time in Ciutadella? We guide you in 2 hours without rushing. <\/div>\n      <div>\n        <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--primary\" href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/visita-guiada-por-ciutadella\/\">Book family tour<\/a>\n        <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--whatsapp\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/34649902301?text=Hola%20Dani%2C%20queremos%20reservar%20el%20tour%20familiar%20por%20Ciutadella\">Ask via WhatsApp<\/a>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/section>\n\n  <section id=\"mediodia-playa\" class=\"vm-section vm-container\">\n    <h2>Midday (12:00\u20133:30 PM): Beach depending on the wind<\/h2>\n    <p>We choose a sheltered beach depending on whether <em>Tramontana<\/em>, <em>Migjorn<\/em>, or <em>Llevant<\/em> is blowing. This usually means better sea for the children. <\/p>\n    <div class=\"vm-grid\">\n      <div class=\"vm-card\">\n        <h3>What wind is blowing today?<\/h3>\n        <ul class=\"vm-list\">\n          <li><strong>Tramontana (N):<\/strong> better to the <em>south<\/em> (e.g., Son Saura, Cala Galdana).<\/li>\n          <li><strong>Migjorn (S\/SW):<\/strong> better to the <em>north<\/em> (e.g., Algaiarens\/La Vall).<\/li>\n          <li><strong>Llevant (E):<\/strong> shelter to the <em>west<\/em> (e.g., Cala Blanca, Cala en Blanes).<\/li>\n        <\/ul>\n        <p class=\"vm-note\">More useful info: <a href=\"\/playas-de-menorca-segun-el-viento\/\">Beaches of Menorca depending on the wind<\/a>.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n      <aside class=\"vm-card\">\n        <h3>Eat &amp; rest<\/h3>\n        <ul class=\"vm-list\">\n          <li>Simple picnic and plenty of cold water.<\/li>\n          <li>Umbrella\/parasol or pine area.<\/li>\n          <li>Flip-flops + jelly shoes for rocks.<\/li>\n          <li>Mineral cream for sensitive skin.<\/li>\n        <\/ul>\n      <\/aside>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/section>\n\n  <section id=\"siesta\" class=\"vm-section vm-container\">\n    <h2>Nap and ice cream (4:00\u20135:00 PM)<\/h2>\n    <p>Return to Ciutadella for a quiet break. Artisan ice cream, playground, and, if it&#8217;s hot, a little shade. <\/p>\n  <\/section>\n\n  <section id=\"tarde-opciones\" class=\"vm-section vm-container vm-grid\">\n    <div class=\"vm-card\">\n      <h2>Afternoon (5:30\u20138:00 PM): two options<\/h2>\n      <h3>A) Pont d\u2019en Gil and west coast<\/h3>\n      <p>Easy and flat walk to the natural arch. Ideal for sunset photos. <span class=\"vm-note\">Closed footwear recommended.<\/span><\/p>\n      <h3>B) Artrutx Lighthouse<\/h3>\n      <p>Easy access and simple parking. Sunset with views of Mallorca on clear days. <\/p>\n    <\/div>\n    <aside class=\"vm-card\">\n      <h3>Guide tip<\/h3>\n      <p>With <em>strong Tramontana<\/em>, the lighthouse is usually more comfortable than the cliffs. With <em>Migjorn<\/em>, Pont d\u2019en Gil is very pleasant. <\/p>\n      <div class=\"vm-cta-block\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">\n        <div class=\"vm-sticker\">Do you want us to organize the day for you?<\/div>\n        <div>\n          <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--primary\" href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/excursiones\/\">See private options<\/a>\n          <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--whatsapp\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/34649902301?text=Hola%20Dani%2C%20%C2%BFpod%C3%A9is%20organizarnos%20el%20itinerario%20familiar%20de%201%20d%C3%ADa%3F\">Talk now<\/a>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/aside>\n  <\/section>\n\n  <section id=\"lluvia\" class=\"vm-section vm-container\">\n    <h2>Plan B if it rains or is very windy<\/h2>\n    <ul class=\"vm-list\">\n      <li>Longer cultural visit in Ciutadella (cloisters, palaces, exhibition halls).<\/li>\n      <li>Craft workshops and local tastings indoors.<\/li>\n      <li>Lighthouse route by car with short stops. More in <a href=\"\/faros\/\">our lighthouse article<\/a>. <\/li>\n    <\/ul>\n  <\/section>\n\n  <section id=\"checklist\" class=\"vm-section vm-container\">\n    <h2>Family checklist<\/h2>\n    <ul class=\"vm-checklist\">\n      <li>Children&#8217;s hats + sunglasses<\/li>\n      <li>2 bottles of frozen water<\/li>\n      <li>Savory snacks and fruit<\/li>\n      <li>Umbrella and large towel<\/li>\n      <li>UV shirt and jelly shoes<\/li>\n      <li>Mineral sunscreen<\/li>\n      <li>Small first aid kit (band-aids, saline solution)<\/li>\n      <li>Waste bag<\/li>\n    <\/ul>\n  <\/section>\n\n  <section id=\"logistica\" class=\"vm-section vm-container vm-grid\">\n    <div class=\"vm-card\">\n      <h2>Logistics and parking<\/h2>\n      <ul class=\"vm-list\">\n        <li><strong>Historic center:<\/strong> signposted public parking and blue zone (check schedules).<\/li>\n        <li><strong>Beaches:<\/strong> arrive early in summer; respect signs and access points.<\/li>\n        <li><strong>Sunset:<\/strong> calculate 30\u201340 min extra for traffic in high season.<\/li>\n      <\/ul>\n    <\/div>\n    <aside class=\"vm-card\">\n      <h3>Book in advance<\/h3>\n      <p>In summer, places fill up quickly. Write to us and we&#8217;ll suggest <em>the beach of the day<\/em> depending on the wind. <\/p>\n      <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--whatsapp\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/34649902301?text=Hola%20Dani%2C%20somos%20una%20familia%20y%20queremos%20hacer%20la%20ruta%20de%201%20d%C3%ADa%20%28salida%20desde%20Ciutadella%29\">Family WhatsApp<\/a>\n    <\/aside>\n  <\/section>\n\n  <section id=\"tiendas-locales\" class=\"vm-section vm-container\">\n    <h2>Local and sustainable shopping<\/h2>\n    <p>For basic equipment (umbrella, buckets, sunscreen, fruit\u2026), prioritize <strong>local stores and markets<\/strong>. This way the money <em>stays in Menorca<\/em> and you support the circular economy. <\/p>\n  <\/section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"faq\" class=\"vm-section vm-container vm-faq\">\n    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions<\/h2>\n    <details>\n      <summary>Can it be done with a stroller?<\/summary>\n      <p>Yes. The morning and the lighthouse are comfortable. In Pont d\u2019en Gil, a baby carrier is better if you get close to the coast.  <\/p>\n    <\/details>\n    <details>\n      <summary>What time is it best to start?<\/summary>\n      <p>9:30 AM usually works well: it&#8217;s less hot and you get to the beach before the peak of affluence.<\/p>\n    <\/details>\n    <details>\n      <summary>Which beach do you recommend with children?<\/summary>\n      <p>It depends on the wind of the day. Write to us via WhatsApp and we will suggest the best option near Ciutadella. <\/p>\n    <\/details>\n    <details>\n      <summary>Are there restrooms and showers?<\/summary>\n      <p>In the center, yes (bars\/market). On beaches, it varies depending on the cove. Bring wipes and a waste bag.  <\/p>\n    <\/details>\n    <details>\n      <summary>Do you offer private tours for families?<\/summary>\n      <p>Yes. We adapt content, times, and stops. See <a href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/excursiones\/\">all excursions<\/a> or contact us via WhatsApp.  <\/p>\n    <\/details>\n  <\/section>\n\n  \n  <div class=\"vm-sticky-cta\" aria-label=\"Acci\u00f3n r\u00e1pida\">\n    <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--primary\" href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/visita-guiada-por-ciutadella\/\" aria-label=\"Reservar tour familiar\">Book<\/a>\n    <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--whatsapp\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/34649902301?text=Hola%20Dani%2C%20qu